Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ana de boka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got back the tag and crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parrotmon Digivolved\Nto Mega Kabuterimon and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sent Vedamont clear\Ninto another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, Brainhead!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.69,0:02:15.15,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Sleeping Tyrant! TonasamaGeckomon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you make this bucket go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching for icebergs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd gladly trade places with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately our little\Nlegs won't reach the pedals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we could go faster if we threw you\Noff You wouldn't It's tempting Better not
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that palace is huge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And way up there As if my\Nlegs weren't tired already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no doubt about\Nit That is Mimi So up we go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do they get their mail?\NAll right, you know the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drill what are you talking\Nabout get out of my way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is this a palace or some kind of\Na loony bit seems like it's both
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh these are geckomon i've heard of them\Nthey really love music not surprising
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Geckomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,375,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,375,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,375,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Amphibian Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,375,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:22.13,Sign,,375,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Crash Symphony
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they're born with those horns,\Nhurry before she blows her tongue.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Otamamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,375,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,375,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,375,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Amphibian Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,375,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.39,0:03:30.18,Sign,,375,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Lullaby Bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i've heard of the other digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're called Otamamon. Hurry, hurry! Can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you help us we're looking for someone\Nby time you got here where's the triple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hot fight sunday we ordered for\Ndelivery to the princess that's not us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must be delivering your bacon\Nchili cheeseburger with fries and a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super-sized milkshake? That's not us\Neither. Of course not, they're delivering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the garden fresh salad with wolf that\Ndressing without dessert we'd like to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask a question if you don't mind her\Nhighness asked for a fun sunday no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she wants a bacon chili cheese burger\Nshe said she wanted a green salad hey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excuse me have you seen a girl in a\Nhat we're ordering lunch here well then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll have a burger all the princess\Nreally cares about is that polka dot party
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dress she ordered old news now she\Nwants pink leather pants with matching
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boots and accessories no one told me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that oh get with the program it sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me like this princess of theirs\Nis extremely picky she sounds kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spoiled if you ask me i wonder what\Nhappens if they don't do what she says Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pre-sledging, her highness, the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, we're gonna get\Nto meet the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me, what\Nare you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being a princess, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the spoiled princess\Nwe've been hearing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have known it was Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Mimi anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Princess now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, almighty wickedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time we cannot fail. We?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better not fail. It's in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the plan at the palace working?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gekkomon are spoiling her\Nrotten and she's eating it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she keeps this up much longer, her\Nquest of sincerity is going to be useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.81,0:05:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what will happen if you\Ndisappoint me again, Demidevimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a big idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, and see that you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the important thing is that\Nyou're all right Yeah, that's for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on, let's get\Na move on No way Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want to change first,\Nwe'll wait For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm keeping this dress\Non And it's beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not the best thing to wear\Nto walk long distances Walking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of\Nwalking anywhere Are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you expecting us to carry you out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not going Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a princess here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, who knows if we'll\Never find our way home,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I might as well live\Nlarge and in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a nice bed, pretty clothes, food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like having a birthday every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you want me to give this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, a voice of reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, come talk some sense in a Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As in princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you change out of those dumb\Nclothes and let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not playing a game, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys go look for the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've gone from my palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to go, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down off that high horse of yours\Nand shift your rear into high gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we almost killed\Nourselves trying to find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you were part of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very nice, but I am not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, Joe's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm not budging from this spot until\Nyou come to your senses and leave with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all keep forgetting\Nwho's in charge around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what is it that you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I desire these rude and bothersome peasants\Nto be removed from my boudoir at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, princess! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't dissect frogs in biology, Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the way you treat your\Nguests, we're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's totally into this digi fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she could've done to get them\Nto wait on her hand and foot like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not taking us to an evil digimon\Nare you what if mimi catches us she won't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's our master lord shogun man\Nwhoa somebody's had a few too many
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,donuts is it a statue or what no it's\Nnot a statue he's very much alive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he may be alive but he's not lively is he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's sleeping he's been\Nthis way for over 300
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, York Shogerman was proud of\Nhis voice and ended his singing contest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He felt so bad, he fell into a deep\Nsleep from which he's never recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said only a voice as beautiful as\Nthe one that beat him can wake him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For centuries we tried,\Nbut every song's failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We, Gekomon, love music,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but unfortunately not one of us has a\Nvoice that would be considered beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we got a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange little Digimon spoke\Nof a girl with a pretty voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told us where to find her, and we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to sing a song,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a song that'll wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I hear my voice, you'll\Ncall me a sweet buttercup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you mean all this is for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will help\Nyou remember the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A song that will wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you hear my voice, you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, this place is too dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we get a disco ball\Nand some spotlights, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, of course, we'll need\Nhair, makeup, and costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pick it up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the way it's been,\None excuse after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done all she's wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've even redecorated\Nthe entire palace for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to like pink, but now\NI can't stand a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if any one of us complains to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want me to lose\Nmy voice now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're in a terrible position, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, you've given Mimi the life\Nshe's been accustomed to, and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did your friends of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please reason with her, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be so eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she knows what reason is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me,\Nguys. I've got it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come through! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, who says you need\NMimi to wake up Jumbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crank it up and let me take a shot! You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sing a song
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A song that will wake you up! I'm\Ngonna belt it out. Sugar and mod,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time to get up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me give it a shot I'm attempting to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sing a song A song\Nthat'll awaken you and aid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the gecko mod That are loyal to your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world view And the idea\Nof you being in charge
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm attempting to sing\Na song A song that'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awaken you and aid all\Nthe Gekomon. I cream this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,song to you A tune from\Nnow until June When
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear us sing. You'll\Ncall us singing for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to wake you\NSo don't close your ears
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you can sleep for years
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. After that, he might not\Nwake up for another 300 years. Hey guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palma Why did you all disappear like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you weren't even happy to\Nsee us What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you hadn't\Nnoticed, Mimi's gone nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, she has\Nkind of gone off the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, even for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so observant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she'll be performing\Nand won't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we'll get the\Nwhole thing on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a karaoke set.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's it doing in my royal chambers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love hearing you sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might give\Nus a private concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, feel the music, feel the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, is she falling for it? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that chord for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you thought you could put a\Nfast one on Princess Mimi, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Princess Mimi! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember we're your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you tried to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried to trick you because\Nwe're trying to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely forgotten\Nabout the quest of sincerity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completely forgotten it's not\Nnice to lock people up in your dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh, before you go, I have\Nsomething I want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes you more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts me deeply to have to say\Nthis, but you're a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:13:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nice to know\Nhow you really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to have your help! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then I won't sing anymore! Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't sing even when\Nwe did what you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sing for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we only help our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were having\Nthe time of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go now, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the car! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, won't anybody help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mimi. Where am I? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what that horrible\Ndream was trying to tell you, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then you know what you\Nhave to do to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd find yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess wants to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she gonna chop off our heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, there's something\NI have to say to everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai and Joe, Agumon and Gomamon, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you've been so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been such a little idiot If\Nyou could find it in your hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to forgive me And I don't know\Nwhy you would But if you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'd be honored to\Nsing for you One more time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We forgive you Of course\Nwe do sing, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you Hit the\Nlights and cue the music
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to sing a song
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A song to bring Shogunmon around When he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hears my voice I hope he likes the sound
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to listen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to my sincere heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:17:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've learned that friends are\Nfriends even when they're apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've asked my friends to forgive\Nme from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's my choice, his eyes will open wide
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the get-go man will be\Ncheering, cheering with pride
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}TonosamaGeckomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,375,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,375,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,375,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Amphibian Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,375,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.65,0:17:39.62,Sign,,375,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Kobushi Tone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our Lord and Master, Shogunmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally restored to us\Nafter so many centuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was having such a nice sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you clowns woke me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should I just squish all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon and Tokomon friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought I was cranky\Nwhen I first wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the main, me, me back any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose idea was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remind me never to listen to him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to hear some singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground will shake when you hear the\Nnoise I make because I'm glad to be awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad old Mimi's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's take care of\Nthis out-of-tune goon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:18:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saved you out of your 300-year\Nnap, you wannabe crooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, have you come to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floverpla!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon Torpedo! Now it's your\Ntime! Now why'd you try that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'll knock your butt!\NAnd now you're gonna feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he gives new meaning\Nto the term flat note
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out below
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions, Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon, Digivolve! MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon into ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends to the boys and girls.\NGive it to a MetalGreymon! Gigablaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends to the boys\Nand girls. Hey Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey Digimon Champions of the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserved to hear that last\Nflat note, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, ready to go, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do you think I could take\Nsome of my princess clothes with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it just seems such a\Nwaste, the jewels at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you knew it\Nwould happen if you failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, when I said I knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really mean that I\Nknew knew, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that I do know if\Nit's not to my trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir, can I bother you\Nfor a glass of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.40,0:21:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to tell you what you're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me now. I'm just\Nlooking at the things
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that are all I'm doing It's not all that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing. It's cold when it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold when it's cold I'm wearing\Na jacket I'm wearing a jacket
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket I'm wearing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a jacket I'm wearing a jacket
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.46,0:22:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish
